- SDF = neural network weights (not distance fields).
- Shaders = WGSL GPU code (not image post-processing).
- 3D = XVG opcodes (not generic matrices).
- CRDT = Lamport timestamps (not naive merges).
- Cite sections from /docs when changing behavior.
